# 🤖 Dola AI — Your 24/7 AI Tech Lead

> **Dola AI** is an automated GitHub-native code review assistant that scans every Pull Request for security risks, logic bugs, best practices, and team style compliance before merge.

## ✨ Features
- 🤖 **Auto Code Review** — Label PR `ready-to-merge` → Dola scans in seconds
- 🔒 **Security First** — Detects vulnerabilities, secrets, and anti-patterns
- 🎯 **Team Standards** — Enforces your coding style & rules
- 📢 **Slack Alerts** — Notify on critical issues
- 📝 **Auto Docs** — Generate release logs & notes
- 🧠 **Fine-tuned** — Custom model trained on your codebase

